<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 60px;
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            font-size: 12pt;
            line-height: 1.4;
            background: white;
            color: black;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 18pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 14pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid black;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        p {
            margin: 8px 0;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .indent {
            margin-left: 40px;
        }

        .centered {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .placeholder {
            border: 2px solid #333;
            background: #f9f9f9;
            color: #666;
            text-align: center;
            font-style: italic;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            min-height: 200px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .placeholder::after {
            content: "CHART / DIAGRAM PLACEHOLDER";
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="title">DOCUMENT TITLE</div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">1. Introduction</div>
        <p>This is the first paragraph of the document. It continues on the same line and demonstrates justified text alignment as seen in the original layout.</p>
        <p class="indent">The second paragraph is indented to simulate standard paragraph spacing and indentation used in formal documents.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">2. Body Content</div>
        <p>This section contains multiple paragraphs with consistent spacing and alignment to match the original spatial layout.</p>
        <p>This is a short paragraph placed exactly where it would appear in the physical document image.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">3. Table Example</div>
        <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:15px 0;">
            <tr>
                <td style="border:1px solid black; padding:8px;">Cell 1</td>
                <td style="border:1px solid black; padding:8px;">Cell 2</td>
                <td style="border:1px solid black; padding:8px;">Cell 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="border:1px solid black; padding:8px;">Row 2, Col 1</td>
                <td style="border:1px solid black; padding:8px;">Row 2, Col 2</td>
                <td style="border:1px solid black; padding:8px;">Row 2, Col 3</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">4. List Example</div>
        <ol>
            <li>First item in the ordered list</li>
            <li>Second item</li>
            <li>Third item with a longer description that wraps correctly</li>
        </ol>
        <ul>
            <li>Unordered list item 1</li>
            <li>Unordered list item 2</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">5. Math Example</div>
        <p>Here is an inline equation: \( a^2 + b^2 = c^2 \)</p>
        <p>Here is a displayed equation:</p>
        <p style="text-align:center;">\[ \int_{0}^{\pi} \sin(x) \, dx = 2 \]</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">6. Footer Section</div>
        <p style="text-align:center; font-size:10pt;">Page 1 of 1 • Document generated from image layout</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
